Original mlx2 candidate code delegates to the lab-owned MIT-licensed local
MLX-VLM source at 8a5e704e0fe43cd8654c144c4ecbd4c8aececeb5. No source
code or model weights are redistributed. The checkpoint contains image and
MTP tensors, but the pinned target model does not execute those components.
The CPU image layout and structural MLX ViT/aligner files are original code
adapted from official MIT-licensed inference/{image_processor,vision,model}.py
at DeepSeek revision 86f746b36186f0e567729a5c06a8c918caba82a9.
